[{"title":"白云","author":"刘崧","text":"一片白云东去微，千片万片相随飞。\n野人望杀田头雨，空逐逍遥神女归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25080,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨来","author":"刘崧","text":"雨来风叶乱萧萧，云散青天转寂寥。\n知有秋霖千万斛，若为忍死待枯苗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25081,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月落","author":"刘崧","text":"月落荒村梦自惊，隔窗人静一灯明。\n狂风忽起楼西树，听得枯枝坠瓦声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25082,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水画","author":"刘崧","text":"遥峰隐隐白云层，乔木春阴落紫藤。\n野客欲归茅店晚，赤栏桥外见鱼罾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25083,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水画","author":"刘崧","text":"江上山根带石盘，长松个个挟风湍。\n飞云又向山中起，閒倚茅亭只静看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25084,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨蒲萄为古心上人赋","author":"刘崧","text":"移根何日渡流沙，万颗神珠烛绛霞。\n岩底月明初入定，骊龙弄影落袈裟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25085,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨蒲萄为古心上人赋","author":"刘崧","text":"龙髯飞动绿云中，寒影扶疏出梵宫。\n数罢念珠心似水，幡幡贝叶动秋风。","coll