otice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25092,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雪中归猎图","author":"刘崧","text":"鹰犬萧萧得隽回，独骑瘦马下崔嵬。\n南山风雪黄斑出，不见将军纵猎来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25093,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹笛","author":"刘崧","text":"仙人夜半吹短笛，呜咽角声长更微。\n云雁绕空愁不下，清霜稍稍傍人飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25094,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题风雨归舟画","author":"刘崧","text":"狂风横雨满江天，纵有高帆未可前。\n别浦宽閒须暂住，莫教吹却钓鱼船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25095,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兰舟词","author":"刘崧","text":"风荡兰舟触石矶，白波如雪卷罗衣。\n香魂只在春江上，化作鸳鸯独自飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25096,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以风雪不果游龙门承故人罗允道寄诗相问依韵奉答","author":"刘崧","text":"雪满空山不可行，怀人幽兴一时清。\n高堂正隔黄泥港，短屐难移冷水坑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25097,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题秋江小景画","author":"刘崧","text":"美人鸣弦思潇湘，斜飞金雁不成行。\n夜深弹彻乌栖曲，月照寒江万树霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25098,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石桥道中","author":"刘崧","text":"一树棠梨溪水头，飞花片片逐溪流。\n行人过尽斜阳暮，何处飞来双锦鸠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25099,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访胡隐君山居","author":"刘崧","text":"屋后青山乱入云，屋前春树绿纷纷。\n松窗晒药无人到，时见西岩过鹿群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25100,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧翀常早起读书畜鸣鸡于楼上以为候为赋一绝","author":"刘崧","text":"高楼笼鸡听早鸣，夜长愁误读书程。\n不道州城烽火后，更声常是不分明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25101,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度三华飞仙桥因忆往年同游者","author":"刘崧","text":"步转危桥入紫烟，曾登绝顶望飞仙。\n五人同赏今谁在，试数重来十五年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25102,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题桃源仙隐","author":"刘崧","text":"昔人筑此事朝真，凿谷开林结构新。\n乱后已无桃李树，惟馀松柏款青春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25103,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书山中老人语","author":"刘崧","text":"山下新亡恶少儿，林间挟弹少来时。\n昨朝鹳鹤争飞过，定结春巢向近枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","po