baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨鹞","author":"刘崧","text":"风翮霜毛劲气多，清秋一点过新罗。\n飞栖不定还惊顾，奈尔山田野雀何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25111,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春昼","author":"刘崧","text":"池南欹柳燕将雏，门巷新晴转绿芜。\n花隔小窗人不到，一帘香雾斗摴蒱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25112,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻吹笛柬萧翀","author":"刘崧","text":"武山曾共赋仙游，按节传觞夜不休。\n恨杀春寒花雨湿，时时吹笛上西楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25113,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见城西有撤民居为城濠者","author":"刘崧","text":"昔人城里筑基牢，撤屋新来又作濠。\n濠底土为城上土，到头谁下复谁高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25114,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中酒","author":"刘崧","text":"银烛频烧夜宴迟，晨光忽觉转檐枝。\n幽人欲起还中酒，卧听西斋读杜诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25115,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题观泉图","author":"刘崧","text":"披图如见锦袍仙，正咏银河落九天。\n百叠云屏烟雾里，石梁听雪定何年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25116,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题折枝梨花","author":"刘崧","text":"最忆梨花白雪香，春